%% aoneahsan-cccs-cloudflare-platform — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Cloudflare platform task, not Worker code]) --> what{What is needed?}

    what -->|email| email[FilesHub — NOT CF Email Service.<br/>CF email only if the owner named it]
    what -->|host a site| pages[Pages — or keep Firebase Hosting<br/>if the project already uses it]
    what -->|DNS / domain / TLS| dns{Owner-only change?<br/>domain move / plan / billing}
    what -->|CAPTCHA / bot protection| turnstile[Turnstile managed mode:<br/>widget → siteverify Worker → frontend → validate]
    what -->|WAF / DDoS / bots| sec[WAF managed rulesets · DDoS auto ·<br/>Bot Management]
    what -->|Zero Trust / Access / Gateway / Tunnel| one[Cloudflare One:<br/>assess first, retrieve docs,<br/>stage risky changes to a pilot]

    dns -->|yes| pause[Pause — ask the owner]
    dns -->|no| retrieve
    pages --> retrieve
    turnstile --> retrieve
    sec --> retrieve
    one --> retrieve

    retrieve[Retrieve current Cloudflare docs<br/>for limits / categories / API — free tier only]
    retrieve --> verify{Verify: gates green /<br/>siteverify validates / policy staged}
    verify -->|fails| retrieve
    verify -->|passes| done([Shipped on the free tier])
    email --> done

    retrieve -.consult if present.-> reg[(../rules/fileshub-api.md · zero-cost.md)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class what,dns,verify gate
    class trigger,done terminal
    class pause warn
